<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks flat at 126,910.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks flat at 126,910.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 14 totaled 126,910 bales, unchanged from the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 198 bales awaiting review, no cancellations, and 2,515 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
